OL,5,G0915 Dirty Home Rescue
OL,6,     FThe team sets out to help an
OL,7,     FAmerican-born dog enthusiast,
OL,8,     Fdiscovering that her home's
OL,9,     Ffilthiness largely stems from her
OL,10,     Fdogs' free-roaming, and shedding,
OL,11,     Flifestyle.
OL,12,G1000 Dirty Home Rescue
OL,13,     FCreative Karen wants to recycle
OL,14,     Fand re-use to help protect the
OL,15,     Fenvironment, but in the process
OL,16,     Fher home is taking a back seat.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/9
