OL,5,G1300 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FDr Amir Khan removes the biggest
OL,7,     Flipoma he has ever seen from
OL,8,     FNigel's chest. Vanda was told she
OL,9,     Fhad only two years to live, but Dr
OL,10,     FChris Harris offers a more
OL,11,     Fpositive prognosis.
OL,12,G1400 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,13,     FDr Amir Khan suspects that Jake's
OL,14,     Fbloody cough could be TB. Varna's
OL,15,     Fbloodshot eye could be acute
OL,16,     Fglaucoma. Luke already has four
OL,17,     Fchildren so he is in for a
OL,18,     Fvasectomy.
